# Cloudflare Pages redirects. StreamOtter's docs (the guides, the API reference, and StreamOtter
# Under the Hood) live on their own site, built from the StreamOtter repository; this site's old
# /docs/ page sends visitors there permanently. /docs/* had no pages, so it goes to the root too.
/docs https://docs.streamotter.dev/ 301
/docs/ https://docs.streamotter.dev/ 301
/docs/* https://docs.streamotter.dev/ 301
